# Linux amdgpu debugfs dumps. Useful as evidence, far too large for git.
# The 512 MB amdgpu_vram dump in particular is regenerated on demand:
#   sudo dd if=/sys/kernel/debug/dri/1/amdgpu_vram of=amdgpu_vram bs=1M count=512
# Targeted reads (GART table, TMR) are ~1-4 MB and are committed instead.
test-tools/linux/New/linux/amdgpu_vram
test-tools/linux/**/*.bin

amdgpu_vram
